atlas optimization-native-clef-runtime

architecture native-clef-runtime
  canonical_name NativeClefRuntime
  owns InstalledDecisionRuntimeLifecycle
  owns PinnedNativeDecisionArtifactPassport
  consumes TypedQuestionProgram
  publishes ArtifactBoundJointDecisionAnswers
  family optimization
  domain Optimization / Local trained typed decision execution
  layer execution
  semantic_question Can ordinary typed decision assessment use one locally owned trained Clef execution process without a hosted dependency or an unbounded permanent model residency?
  purpose Bind a pinned native Qwen3.5 and joint Clef head implementation to quantized published model bytes, expose a lazy shared local owner, and preserve exact decision contracts through bounded authenticated loopback transport.
  maturity implemented
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/native/clef-runtime.lock.json
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/native/build-clef.sh
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/native/patches/clef-output-embedding.patch
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/local-systemone.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/installed-runtime.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/tests/trained-runtime-witness.mjs
  source_lineage ggml-org/llama.cpp PR 29831 at 1e265f2111a894c85560d667216d4dd7930474dc; pinned unmerged text-only Clef implementation
  source_lineage ggml-org/Clef-Flash-GGUF at 4a7a08c09bc63baf043b62b5ba89dd67a0357d95; Cloudflare/clef-flash source checkpoint 17f0b0ad64efb65d273590632833508766b2aae6
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/clef-runtime-build-witness.json records a successful Darwin arm64 CPU, Metal and Accelerate native build, source archive and binary fingerprints, system-only dynamic dependencies, and version/help checks; it explicitly does not witness trained inference
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/clef-runtime-patched-build-witness.json records the Clef-only output-buffer classification fix, canonical patch digest, incremental native rebuild, new binary passport and preserved original; it does not itself witness trained inference
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/trained-cpu-unrepacked-witness.json retains one actual 139-token quantized trained-model response on CPU with repacking disabled, demonstrating execution and the loader-layout diagnosis but not accuracy, numerical parity or performance advantage
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/trained-runtime-witness.json retains five actual quantized trained-model assessments through the installed default owner across ContextCut, MCP, Flow and ExternalEstate, with complete answers, implementation identity and hardware timings; these authored examples are integration evidence, not held-out accuracy or throughput evidence
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/clef-runtime-build.test.mjs proves pinned source admission, fresh output ownership, offline packaging and receipt guards with a mocked compiler rather than a trained model
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/local-systemone.test.mjs proves owned loopback child lifecycle, typed answer validation, immutable artifact admission, request and response bounds, cancellation, marker and media refusal, explicit confidence semantics, and shared assessment integration using offline fixtures
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/installed-runtime.test.mjs proves no-start lazy identity, single shared startup, caller-isolated cancellation, retry after startup failure, joined shutdown, idle eviction outside active requests, passport mutation refusal and refusal to replace a child after failed shutdown
  node_types NativeRuntimeLock
  node_types ModelArtifactPassport
  node_types LazyDecisionOwner
  node_types OwnedLoopbackChild
  state_types absent / starting / ready / retiring / shutdown-refused
  internal_calculus source and local binary pins plus actual model digest -> authenticated owned child -> one text prefill with joint schema head -> complete typed probability answers -> shared owner projection
  internal_calculus lazy descriptor -> one cached startup promise -> active caller leases -> sixty-second idle retirement -> joined shutdown before replacement
  invariant normal planning exposes the same immutable model and implementation passport as execution without hashing model bytes or starting a process
  invariant the production factory verifies actual binary and model sizes, SHA-256 digests and file identity; synthetic fixtures cannot be relabeled as the released model
  invariant the implementation passport binds native and model pins, adapter source bytes, context geometry, confidence semantics and effective transport limits
  invariant a private loopback child uses an API-key file rather than an argv secret; authenticated properties bind readiness to the pinned model path, alias and context
  invariant the child starts offline with automatic fit, agent, web UI and MCP proxy disabled; missing or mismatched artifacts refuse without hosted fallback
  invariant this machine uses explicit CPU device selection with GPU layers, operation offload and KV offload disabled; those physical settings are bound into the implementation passport
  invariant admitted execution is text-only with 2048 context, batch and microbatch tokens, one sequence, no prefix cache and explicit overflow refusal rather than silent truncation
  invariant question IDs and option labels remain text even when named images or audio; unsupported question-descriptor fields refuse instead of disappearing in native parsing, and state media, byte, depth and reserved-marker checks remain enforced
  invariant the GGUF representation uses Q4_K backbone mixture, Q8_0 decision matrices, Q6_K output embeddings and F32 norms; it is not the original BF16 representation
  invariant the hash-pinned local loader patch selects a GET_ROWS-compatible output embedding buffer only for Clef; non-Clef output matrix-multiplication layout is unchanged
  known_gap initial all-Metal execution exhausted device memory alongside the existing Qwen service; the declared local placement must not be interpreted as a validated GPU execution profile
  invariant confidence is declared as typesafe-uniform-adjusted rather than silently equated with Cloudflare maximum-option probability or calibrated correctness
  invariant local execution is declared nondeterministic and does not enter deterministic cross-request logit reuse
  invariant one caller abandoning startup cannot cancel another caller's startup; model residency expires only after all active or waiting callers release the owner
  invariant shutdown joins the owned process and cleanup; failure to establish termination latches refusal instead of starting another model process
  invariant normal startup and request limits are each 120 seconds; wire request and response limits are 65536 and 262144 bytes respectively
  forbidden_inference native compilation, offline transport tests or installed model bytes -> verified trained inference, numerical BF16 parity, production accuracy, calibrated confidence or end-to-end cost savings
  forbidden_inference local model execution or complete probability distributions -> candidate admission, source truth, authority, permission, automatic work claims or executable effects
  known_gap the pinned runtime comes from unmerged upstream PR 29831 rather than a merged release; upgrades require renewed source, binary and behavioral review
  known_gap no numerical comparison with the original BF16 framework execution or labeled Bonfyre quality and operational cost evaluation is established by these witnesses
  known_gap the implemented native runtime is a separate GGML execution realization; it does not establish trained parity for the standalone Bonfyre C head or encoder bridge
  known_gap text-only 2048-token admission does not establish multimodal support, full upstream context length, prefix reuse, browser portability or multi-sequence throughput
  known_gap the approved binary passport is specific to the recorded Darwin arm64 build; another platform or toolchain requires its own reviewed binary passport
  interacts decision-plane
  interacts decision-program

interaction native-clef-runtime-serves-decision-plane
  source native-clef-runtime
  destination decision-plane
  relation lazy_installed_owner_to_artifact_bound_joint_assessment
  preserves complete authored question schema and option identity, joint field semantics, explicit confidence statistic, model and implementation provenance, information policy, cancellation and bounded execution
  drops hosted provider dependency, autoregressive answer generation, unsupported media, implicit remote fallback and permanently resident idle model processes
  authority exact candidate owners retain masks, freshness, evidence and effect authorization; the native model supplies a non-effecting diagnostic only
  invalidates_on model or binary bytes, adapter implementation, declared execution limits, question program, exact owner contract or runtime passport change
  forbidden_inference local trained computation or an artifact digest -> a correct answer, permission to apply a proposal, authenticated external labels or measured system savings
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/local-systemone.test.mjs
  witness components/BonfyreDecision/tests/installed-runtime.test.mjs
  binding components/BonfyreDecision/installed-runtime.mjs
  binding components/BonfyreDecision/local-systemone.mjs
  binding components/BonfyreDecision/decision-plane.mjs

interaction native-clef-runtime-serves-source-review
  source native-clef-runtime
  destination decision-program
  relation shared_installed_owner_to_exact_source_assessment
  preserves per-source authored questions, artifact and implementation identity, complete probabilities, total execution budget and explicit information policy
  drops a second native process, implicit hosted egress, duplicated execution ownership and cross-source joint attention
  authority ExternalEstate retains source standing, rights, admission and effect authority; local inference supplies diagnostic review only
  invalidates_on source descriptor, question program, information policy, model artifact or native implementation change
  forbidden_inference shared local execution -> source truth, recurring production value or permission to publish
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/decision_program_plane.test.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/decision_program_plane.mjs
  binding components/BonfyreDecision/local-inference.mjs
  binding components/BonfyreDecision/installed-runtime.mjs
